Package: visu
Title: House ggplot2 Theme, NC Colour Palette, and Chart-Building Functions
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Joe", "Crowley", email = "joeac121@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A consistent ggplot2 house theme (theme_house()); a work-
    compatible five-family tint-ramp colour palette (nc_alt1) with matching
    scale_*_pal_*() categorical, sequential, gradient, and diverging scale
    functions; and calc_stats()-aware bar chart builders (bar(),
    bar_clustered(), bar_stacked()) for upright, clustered, and stacked bar
    charts with automatic label wrapping, orientation flipping, and value-
    label placement. finalise_plot() gives every exported chart consistent
    export dimensions.
